Mentor-Protégé Program,"The Mentor-Protégé Program is designed to improve the performance of contracts and subcontracts, foster the establishment of long-term business relationships between large prime contractors and small business subcontractors, and increase subcontracting opportunities and accomplishments. Ultimately, the MPP goal is to assist small businesses to expand the overall base of their marketplace participation and to produce more jobs and increase national income. General Dynamics demonstrates our commitment to improving and strengthening small business performance by participating in a variety of federal Mentor-Protégé programs, including with the Departments of Defense and Homeland Security, NASA and others. Various U.S. government agencies have their own unique MPPs. To learn more about the individual agency programs, please consult with the appropriate Government Small Business Office for detailed information on specific programs and their requirements. If you qualify to participate in a specific agencies MPP, and have an interest in participating in the MPP with a GD business unit, please contact the appropriate Supplier Liaison. Are you a current subcontractor with General Dynamics? The Mentor-Protégé Program is a huge commitment for both mentors and mentees. Therefore, General Dynamics does not pursue MPP relationships with businesses that we do not already have an active working relationship with. Do you have a contact at General Dynamics that will serve as your “champion?” We strongly recommend working closely your GD management team to ensure program “buy-in.” The program team has final ownership of any MPP agreements and is a great starting point for businesses looking to learn more about the program. Have you identified your federal client’s “pain-points” and upcoming opportunities? Our most successful MPP agreements occur when the future goals of the small business align with the needs of the customer. A well-developed pipeline and relevant customer intimacy provides a strong incentive for a pursuing an MPP agreement. Do you know which Mentor-Protégé Program you are interested in pursuing? There are several different MPP programs including the SBA, DoD, NASA, and others. Research the different available programs and identify the best fit for your business.",https://www.gd.com/suppliers/mentor-protege-program,General Dynamics Suppliers,,,Em andamento,,tecnologias_estrategicas,monitoramento_oportunidades_publicas,contratacao_publica,"{'regiao': '', 'setor_estrategico': 'defesa_industrial', 'subtema': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'area_cientifica': [], 'area_tecnologica': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'tipo_oportunidade': 'supplier_portal', 'empresa_prime': '', 'orgao_contratante': 'General Dynamics Suppliers', 'pais': 'US', 'idioma_original': '', 'titulo_original': '', 'descricao_original': '', 'titulo_traduzido': '', 'descricao_traduzida': '', 'orgao_responsavel': '', 'instituicao': '', 'numero_edital': '', 'numero_chamada': '', 'numero_processo': '', 'codigo_oportunidade': '', 'modalidade': '', 'publico_alvo': '', 'elegibilidade': '', 'objetivo': '', 'escopo': '', 'itens_financiaveis': [], 'itens_nao_financiaveis': [], 'valor_total': '', 'valor_por_projeto': '', 'contrapartida': '', 'prazo_execucao': '', 'cronograma': [], 'documentos': [], 'pdf_url': '', 'pdf_texto_extraido': '', 'pdf_resumo': '', 'data_publicacao_original': '', 'fim_inscricao_original': '', 'prazo_submissao_original': '', 'metodo_extracao': 'html_listing_detail', 'url_listagem': 'https://www.gd.com/suppliers', 'url_detalhe': 'https://www.gd.com/suppliers/mentor-protege-program', 'nivel_sensibilidade': 'publico_institucional', 'contexto_sensivel_detectado': False, 'marcadores_contexto_sensivel': [], 'origem': 'https://www.gd.com/suppliers/mentor-protege-program', 'palavras_chave_detectadas': ['defense', 'small business', 'supplier'], 'necessita_traducao': False, 'observacoes': '', 'tipo_recurso': 'contratacao_publica', 'natureza_recurso': 'contratual', 'reembolsavel': None}"
SUPPLIERS,"General Dynamics Land Systems’ Supply Chain Management organization is committed to managing the supply chain to consistently deliver on-time, high-quality, and cost-effective materials and services to our customers. This is achieved by fostering best-in-class relationships and implementing core processes across all General Dynamics Land Systems organizations, customers, and our valued supply base. We emphasize open communication, mutual trust, continuous improvement, and adherence to the highest ethical standards. For small business opportunities, please contact: Malaya Abed, Small Business Liaison Officer",https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/,General Dynamics Suppliers,,,Em andamento,,tecnologias_estrategicas,monitoramento_oportunidades_publicas,contratacao_publica,"{'regiao': '', 'setor_estrategico': 'defesa_industrial', 'subtema': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'area_cientifica': [], 'area_tecnologica': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'tipo_oportunidade': 'supplier_portal', 'empresa_prime': '', 'orgao_contratante': 'General Dynamics Suppliers', 'pais': 'US', 'idioma_original': '', 'titulo_original': '', 'descricao_original': '', 'titulo_traduzido': '', 'descricao_traduzida': '', 'orgao_responsavel': '', 'instituicao': '', 'numero_edital': '', 'numero_chamada': '', 'numero_processo': '', 'codigo_oportunidade': '', 'modalidade': '', 'publico_alvo': '', 'elegibilidade': '', 'objetivo': '', 'escopo': '', 'itens_financiaveis': [], 'itens_nao_financiaveis': [], 'valor_total': '', 'valor_por_projeto': '', 'contrapartida': '', 'prazo_execucao': '', 'cronograma': [], 'documentos': [{'nome': 'ETHICS & CONDUCT BLUE BOOK (v7)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-Supplier-Code-of-Conduct-Ethics-7th-Edition.pdf'}, {'nome': 'SUPPLIER PERFORMANCE', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/GDLS-Global-Supplier-Performance-Scorecard-2025-12-external.pdf'}, {'nome': 'GENERAL BIDDING INSTRUCTIONS', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bidders_060727.pdf'}, {'nome': 'SUPPLIER MANUAL', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Eng-SCM-MANUALSCM046-rev11.pdf'}, {'nome': 'USER CERTIFICATION SECURITY ASSESSMENT', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-USER-CERTIFICATION-SECURITY-ASSESSMENT.pdf'}, {'nome': 'Download Brochure', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/00326-Supply-Chain-Flyer-8.5x11.pdf'}], 'pdf_url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-Supplier-Code-of-Conduct-Ethics-7th-Edition.pdf', 'pdf_texto_extraido': '7th Edition, 2025 Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct 7th Edition, 2025 Message from the CEO 3 Our Ethos 4 Business Ethics Principles 6 Business Ethics Model 7 About this Booklet 8 Conducting our Business 10 Working with Government Customers and Public Officials 14 Working Together 16 Protecting our Resources 18 Taking Action 20 Index 23 Ethics Helpline Phone Numbers 24 Table of Contents GENERAL DYNAMICS BLUE BOOK | 3 Dear Fellow Employee: Ethical business conduct is not just a part of what we do—it is the heart of everything we do. Our culture of consistently doing the right thing for our employees, customers, and stakeholders has made General Dynamics what it is today, and it is what will continue to propel us forward in the future. We are a global company of talented people doing a broad range of business activities across different segments. Our Ethos is what unites us and gives us a shared commitment to maintaining the highest standards of ethics and integrity in everything we do. The intent of the General Dynamics Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct, which we call the Blue Book , is to give you the tools necessary to embed ethical decision-making into all aspects of your work, and to confidently address ethics-related questions as they arise. But our Ethos is about more than just following laws and policies. It is about relentlessly striving to adhere to our core values of transparency, honesty, trust and alignment. Read the Blue Book carefully, and refer back to it regularly. These are the principles upon which this company is built, and which ensure we fulfill our duty to act responsibly towards our customers, investors, employees and communities. Each of us has a duty to uphold the high standards that made the company great. Sincerely, Phebe N. Novakovic Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Message from the CEO', 'pdf_resumo': '7th Edition, 2025 Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct 7th Edition, 2025 Message from the CEO 3 Our Ethos 4 Business Ethics Principles 6 Business Ethics Model 7 About this Booklet 8 Conducting our Business 10 Working with Government Customers and Public Officials 14 Working Together 16 Protecting our Resources 18 Taking Action 20 Index 23 Ethics Helpline Phone Numbers 24 Table of Contents GENERAL DYNAMICS BLUE BOOK | 3 Dear Fellow Employee: Ethical business conduct is not just a part of what', 'data_publicacao_original': '', 'fim_inscricao_original': '', 'prazo_submissao_original': '', 'metodo_extracao': 'html_listing_detail', 'url_listagem': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/', 'url_detalhe': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/', 'nivel_sensibilidade': 'publico_institucional', 'contexto_sensivel_detectado': False, 'marcadores_contexto_sensivel': [], 'origem': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/', 'palavras_chave_detectadas': ['land systems', 'small business', 'supplier'], 'necessita_traducao': False, 'observacoes': '', 'tipo_recurso': 'contratacao_publica', 'natureza_recurso': 'contratual', 'reembolsavel': None}"
CYBERSECURITY,"In accordance with DFARS 252.204-7012 Safeguarding Covered Defense Information and Cyber Incident Reporting, subcontractors, including vendors and consultants, are required to rapidly report cyber incidents within 72 hours of discovery directly to Department of Defense (DoD) at https://www.dc3.mil/Missions/DIB-Cybersecurity/DIB-Cybersecurity-DCISE/. This includes providing the incident report number, automatically assigned by DoD and to General Dynamics Land Systems as soon as practical. In the event of a Cybersecurity Incident: Access: DoD-Defense Industrial Base (DIB) Collaborative Information Sharing Environment (DCISE) You will fill out your reporting information as you do in the current portal. There is an additional necessary step. The site will generate a .xml file for you to download. You must submit this file to DC3 via encrypted email or DoD SAFE in order to comply with the DFARS reporting requirement. DC3 will respond to confirm receipt and provide an incident number and a copy of the ICF in txt format for reference. In addition, please notify your GDLS Buyer and the GDLS Security team at [email protected] or 586-825-8646. Please include a detailed report of the incident including the following, as able: Date and Time of when the Event took place Summary on the Event and how it was detected Scope (Functional Impact, Informational Impact, and Recoverability Impact) of the Incident 252.204-7008 Compliance with Safeguarding Covered Defense Information (Oct 2016) All solicitations, including solicitations using FAR part 12 procedures for the acquisition of commercial items, except for solicitations solely for the acquisition of commercially available off-the-shelf (COTS) items 252.204-7009 Limitation on the Use or Disclosure of Third Party Contractor Reported Cyber Incident Information (Oct 2016) All solicitations and contracts, including solicitations and contracts using FAR part 12 procedures for the acquisition of commercial items, for services that include support for the Government’s activities related to safeguarding covered defense information and cyber incident reporting 252.204-7012 Safeguarding Covered Defense Information and Cyber Incident Reporting (Oct 2016) All solicitations and contracts, including solicitations and contracts using FAR part 12 procedures for the acquisition of commercial items, except for solicitations and contracts solely for the acquisition of COTS items",https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/cybersecurity/,General Dynamics Suppliers,,,Em andamento,,tecnologias_estrategicas,monitoramento_oportunidades_publicas,contratacao_publica,"{'regiao': '', 'setor_estrategico': 'defesa_industrial', 'subtema': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'area_cientifica': [], 'area_tecnologica': ['fornecedores_defesa'], 'tipo_oportunidade': 'supplier_portal', 'empresa_prime': '', 'orgao_contratante': 'General Dynamics Suppliers', 'pais': 'US', 'idioma_original': '', 'titulo_original': '', 'descricao_original': '', 'titulo_traduzido': '', 'descricao_traduzida': '', 'orgao_responsavel': '', 'instituicao': '', 'numero_edital': '', 'numero_chamada': '', 'numero_processo': '', 'codigo_oportunidade': '', 'modalidade': '', 'publico_alvo': '', 'elegibilidade': '', 'objetivo': '', 'escopo': '', 'itens_financiaveis': [], 'itens_nao_financiaveis': [], 'valor_total': '', 'valor_por_projeto': '', 'contrapartida': '', 'prazo_execucao': '', 'cronograma': [], 'documentos': [{'nome': 'ETHICS & CONDUCT BLUE BOOK (v7)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-Supplier-Code-of-Conduct-Ethics-7th-Edition.pdf'}, {'nome': 'SUPPLIER PERFORMANCE', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/GDLS-Global-Supplier-Performance-Scorecard-2025-12-external.pdf'}, {'nome': 'NIST SP 800-171', 'url': 'http://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/NIST.SP.800-171.pdf?utm_source=gdmissionsystems.com&utm_medium=pdf&utm_campaign=link'}], 'pdf_url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-Supplie