loads/2026/01/GDLS-Global-Supplier-Performance-Scorecard-2025-12-external.pdf'}, {'nome': 'Quality Clauses', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/QUALITY-CLAUSES-3.4.26.pdf'}, {'nome': 'Control Test (QCS-4A)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QCS-4A.pdf'}, {'nome': 'Environmental Test Methods (ATPD-2167)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ATPD-2167_020209.pdf'}, {'nome': 'First Article Approval (QCS-4)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/qcs4.pdf'}, {'nome': 'First Article Inspection (QCS-83-4)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/qcs83-4.pdf'}, {'nome': 'Requirements for ATE Test Software (QCS-5)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/qcs_5.pdf'}, {'nome': 'SCM-084 Engineering Non-Conforming Hardware (E-NCH)', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SCM-084-Engineering-Non-Conforming-Hardware-E-NCH_11202_V2025.pdf'}, {'nome': 'FAI Guide', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/FAI-Guide-Dec-16-2025-FINAL.pdf'}, {'nome': 'AS9102C Numbered Explanation', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/AS9102C-Numbered-Explanation-Dec-2025-FINAL.pdf'}, {'nome': '4496 – QA Externally Threaded Steel Fasteners', 'url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-C-4496-QA-Externally-Threaded-Steel-Fasteners.pdf'}], 'pdf_url': 'https://www.gdls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GDLS-Supplier-Code-of-Conduct-Ethics-7th-Edition.pdf', 'pdf_texto_extraido': '7th Edition, 2025 Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct 7th Edition, 2025 Message from the CEO 3 Our Ethos 4 Business Ethics Principles 6 Business Ethics Model 7 About this Booklet 8 Conducting our Business 10 Working with Government Customers and Public Officials 14 Working Together 16 Protecting our Resources 18 Taking Action 20 Index 23 Ethics Helpline Phone Numbers 24 Table of Contents GENERAL DYNAMICS BLUE BOOK | 3 Dear Fellow Employee: Ethical business conduct is not just a part of what we do—it is the heart of everything we do. Our culture of consistently doing the right thing for our employees, customers, and stakeholders has made General Dynamics what it is today, and it is what will continue to propel us forward in the future. We are a global company of talented people doing a broad range of business activities across different segments. Our Ethos is what unites us and gives us a shared commitment to maintaining the highest standards of ethics and integrity in everything we do. The intent of the General Dynamics Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct, which we call the Blue Book , is to give you the tools necessary to embed ethical decision-making into all aspects of your work, and to confidently address ethics-related questions as they arise. But our Ethos is about more than just following laws and policies. It is about relentlessly striving to adhere to our core values of transparency, honesty, trust and alignment. Read the Blue Book carefully, and refer back to it regularly. These are the principles upon which this company is built, and which ensure we fulfill our duty to act responsibly towards our customers, investors, employees and communities. Each of us has a duty to uphold the high standards that made the company great. Sincerely, Phebe N. Novakovic Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Message from the CEO', 'pdf_resumo': '7th Edition, 2025 Standards of Business Ethics and Conduct 7th Edition, 2025 Message from the CEO 3 Our Ethos 4 Business Ethics Principles 6 Business Ethics Model 7 About this Booklet 8 Conducting our Business 10 Working with Government Customers and Public Officials 14 Working Together 16 Protecting our Resources 18 Taking Action 20 Index 23 Ethics Helpline Phone Numbers 24 Table of Contents GENERAL DYNAMICS BLUE BOOK | 3 Dear Fellow Employee: Ethical business conduct is not just a part of what', 'data_publicacao_original': '', 'fim_inscricao_original': '', 'prazo_submissao_original': '', 'metodo_extracao': 'html_listing_detail', 'url_listagem': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/', 'url_detalhe': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/quality/', 'nivel_sensibilidade': 'publico_institucional', 'contexto_sensivel_detectado': False, 'marcadores_contexto_sensivel': [], 'origem': 'https://www.gdls.com/suppliers/quality/', 'palavras_chave_detectadas': [], 'necessita_traducao': False, 'observacoes': '', 'tipo_recurso': 'contratacao_publica', 'natureza_recurso': 'contratual', 'reembolsavel': None}"
